    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39577" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικατα-βαίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>go down to</i> a place, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς Πλαταιάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.25
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.97
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὴν θάλασσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.23
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				35
			</span></i>; <i>extend downwards</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδύναι
				ἐς τὰς χεῖρας ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
